{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>My autumn</b> — my greatness was without parallel, if [we interpret] according to the context. Some say: it is from: \"when they arrayed battle against the Philistines\" (2 Samuel 10:6). Some say: it is from <i>ḥoref</i> (autumn), for there the seed begins."], :book :job, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 29, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Job -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/eyov/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:03:54.160329589Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}